{"id":54356,"date":"2026-07-22T08:27:13","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T07:27:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54356"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:40:48","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:40:48","slug":"vulcan-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vulcan-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vulcan Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vulcan Trail 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no primeiro domingo do ano, <strong>3 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na localidade de <strong>Igreja Nova<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovido pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova<\/strong>, o evento convida os apaixonados pelo trail running a abrir o ano com uma aventura emocionante pelos trilhos ancestrais da regi\u00e3o saloia.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada instaladas em Igreja Nova, o evento integra o <strong>Trail Longo K20+ (20 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto K12+ (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong>. Os percursos exploram as colinas e vales do Complexo Vulc\u00e2nico da regi\u00e3o de Mafra, oferecendo medalha finisher exclusiva, abastecimentos de refor\u00e7o, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e uma tradicional refei\u00e7\u00e3o quente com sandes de peru no espeto em afamado p\u00e3o de Mafra e fatia de bolo-rei.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-